<title>HONG KONG: Deutsche Bk sets warrants on blue-chip prop basket.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bk sets warrants on blue-chip prop basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG, London Branch, said on Monday it planned to issue 500 million American-style call warrants on a basket of two blue-chip property stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd	     0.04 shares</p>
<p> Sun Hung Kai Properties Ltd	    0.07 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$8.892	 PREMIUM	 11.1 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.2085	GEARING	 4.7x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   19.MAY.98	PAYDATE	 02.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG	LISTING DATE  04.JUN.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$9.88	  EXER LOT	10,000</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW	HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		   CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT</p>
<p>			  ISSUER'S DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
